{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function put<T>(\n   objectStore,\n   value,\nkey?): Promise<IDBValidKey>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: packages/db/src/indexed-db-wrapper.ts:429"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Writes an item to an object store using upsert semantics."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If an item with the same key exists, it will be replaced.\nIf no item with the key exists, a new one will be created."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"t","children":[{"type":"text","value":"T"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"T"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type of the item"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"objectstore","children":[{"type":"text","value":"objectStore"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"IDBObjectStore"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The IDBObjectStore to write to"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"value","children":[{"type":"text","value":"value"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"T"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The item to write"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"key","children":[{"type":"text","value":"key?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"IDBValidKey"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional key for the item. Required if the object store doesn't have a keyPath."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"IDBValidKey"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A promise that resolves to the key of the written item"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"// With keyPath (key extracted from value)\nawait executeTransaction(db, 'todos', 'readwrite', async (tx, stores) => {\n  const key = await put(stores.todos, { id: 1, text: 'Buy milk' })\n  console.log('Wrote item with key:', key)\n})\n\n// Without keyPath (explicit key)\nawait executeTransaction(db, 'items', 'readwrite', async (tx, stores) => {\n  const key = await put(stores.items, { text: 'Some data' }, 'myKey')\n  console.log('Wrote item with key:', key)\n})","lang":"typescript"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"t","text":"T","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"objectstore","text":"objectStore","level":3},{"id":"value","text":"value","level":3},{"id":"key","text":"key?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction put<T>(\n   objectStore,\n   value,\nkey?): Promise<IDBValidKey>;\n```\n\nDefined in: packages/db/src/indexed-db-wrapper.ts:429\n\nWrites an item to an object store using upsert semantics.\n\nIf an item with the same key exists, it will be replaced.\nIf no item with the key exists, a new one will be created.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T`\n\nThe type of the item\n\n## Parameters\n\n### objectStore\n\n`IDBObjectStore`\n\nThe IDBObjectStore to write to\n\n### value\n\n`T`\n\nThe item to write\n\n### key?\n\n`IDBValidKey`\n\nOptional key for the item. Required if the object store doesn't have a keyPath.\n\n## Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<`IDBValidKey`\\>\n\nA promise that resolves to the key of the written item\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\n// With keyPath (key extracted from value)\nawait executeTransaction(db, 'todos', 'readwrite', async (tx, stores) => {\n  const key = await put(stores.todos, { id: 1, text: 'Buy milk' })\n  console.log('Wrote item with key:', key)\n})\n\n// Without keyPath (explicit key)\nawait executeTransaction(db, 'items', 'readwrite', async (tx, stores) => {\n  const key = await put(stores.items, { text: 'Some data' }, 'myKey')\n  console.log('Wrote item with key:', key)\n})\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: put\ntitle: put\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction put<T>(\n   objectStore,\n   value,\nkey?): Promise<IDBValidKey>;\n```\n\nDefined in: packages/db/src/indexed-db-wrapper.ts:429\n\nWrites an item to an object store using upsert semantics.\n\nIf an item with the same key exists, it will be replaced.\nIf no item with the key exists, a new one will be created.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T`\n\nThe type of the item\n\n## Parameters\n\n### objectStore\n\n`IDBObjectStore`\n\nThe IDBObjectStore to write to\n\n### value\n\n`T`\n\nThe item to write\n\n### key?\n\n`IDBValidKey`\n\nOptional key for the item. Required if the object store doesn't have a keyPath.\n\n## Returns\n\n`Promise`\\<`IDBValidKey`\\>\n\nA promise that resolves to the key of the written item\n\n## Example\n\n```typescript\n// With keyPath (key extracted from value)\nawait executeTransaction(db, 'todos', 'readwrite', async (tx, stores) => {\n  const key = await put(stores.todos, { id: 1, text: 'Buy milk' })\n  console.log('Wrote item with key:', key)\n})\n\n// Without keyPath (explicit key)\nawait executeTransaction(db, 'items', 'readwrite', async (tx, stores) => {\n  const key = await put(stores.items, { text: 'Some data' }, 'myKey')\n  console.log('Wrote item with key:', key)\n})\n```\n"}
